    <Description>Description:
Macro for the game Fishing Planet, With a single key you can Cast, Reel &amp; Store fish in keepnet. You will need to adjust the notch on your reel depending on your tackle weight.

Screen Resolution Test:
1920 x 1080
2560 x 1440

Use for Macro:
Good for Predator Fishing - Straight/Straight &amp; Slow

INSTRUCTIONS:
1. Start the game
2. Disable Space from your reel key in your keybinds
3. Assign the macro to a key of your choice
4. Go to lake and look out towards the middle
5. Press the key that you assigned to the macro

You will need to check in to change the day to empty your keepnet manually.

Will be uploading more Macros for other fishing methods soon!</Description>
